      "message": "CMake: Win32: Find Lua in the vcpkg or our old directory structure\n\nThe patched Lua zip distributions we have provided don't have the\ndirectory structure (with bin and lib) that the vcpkg packages do.\nSupport both, by looking for the bin subdirectory first.\n\nWe have been providing the pdbs with the old zip package as well,\nbut not looking for them. Add them.\n",
